OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa few outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, although the odd clear spell
OL,8,Fis also likely to develop. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening through the early hours
OL,10,Fof the morning. Staying mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy and rather windy
OL,13,Fstart. A blustery rainband, locally
OL,14,Fheavy, moves east from late morning,
OL,15,Fclearing early afternoon. Sunny spells
OL,16,Ffollow, but staying breezy and feeling
OL,17,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
